  "ruleText": "Tax 213.01 Applicability. This part, as well as Tax 201, and Tax 202, shall apply to all timber tax appeals under RSA 79:8.\n\nSource. #7874-B, eff 4-18-03; ss by #8987-A, eff 9-24-07; ss by #9538, eff 9-8-09; ss by #9538, eff 9-8-09; ss by #10625-B, eff 6-26-14; ss by #13711-B, eff 8-2-23",
